 16722	def _deinit_strip_claude(root: Path) -> bool:
 16723	    """剝 CLAUDE.md 與 Codex 指示檔(AGENTS.md / AGENTS.override.md)的 LUMOS:GRAPH-DISCIPLINE 區塊;
